    {
      "id": "engineering",
      "topic": "engineering",
      "basis": "interpretation",
      "text": "早期注入与后期缓存失效构成两层接线，避免覆盖桌面传输；可借鉴最小兼容补丁；移除后仍需整页重载使全局事实恢复，撤销行为待验证。代价是修改全局私有协议与只读属性，启动时序或宿主缓存结构变化会破坏收益。 源码依据：[client.js](https://github.com/6mt/dsh-plugin-loopback-trust/blob/838ddf0d79fb977be896c6cb5dcd0bba68015832/client.js)、[index.js](https://github.com/6mt/dsh-plugin-loopback-trust/blob/838ddf0d79fb977be896c6cb5dcd0bba68015832/index.js)、[package.json](https://github.com/6mt/dsh-plugin-loopback-trust/blob/838ddf0d79fb977be896c6cb5dcd0bba68015832/package.json)。",
